If you are using lm.RRPP you have to coerce the coordinates into a matrix with two.d.array. Alternatively, you can use procD.lm instead of lm.rrpp. It’s just how your data are arranged (3D array) and trying to use a function that expects them to be arrange differently (a 2D i.e., a matrix).

Best,
Mike

